<p class="eb">About us</p><h2>We’re Loomie.</h2>
<p>We help small and medium-sized businesses win back the hours their teams lose to repetitive work: copying data, answering the same emails, preparing reports.</p>
<p>Between us we cover both sides. One of us is an AI engineer with over five years of experience; the other comes from operations management and knows exactly where lost time hides. We turn tasks that take hours into minutes, keep it simple, and work inside the tools you already use.</p>
<p class="ask">Have twenty minutes to spare? Let’s find the one process that costs your team the most time.</p></div>
